# Clerk Toast — Emil Kowalski-style stacked toasts: tapping any black row pushes
# the next of 13 scripted toasts; up to 3 are visible, stacked from the bottom
# (newest lowest), older ones collapse behind with fading content and shadows;
# any toast swipes left to dismiss (> 50pt), and the 8th toast has an X that
# clears the whole stack (FadeOutLeft exit staggered by stack id).
# What this test covers: pushing three toasts, swipe-dismissing the newest
# (stack re-springs), a short swipe that snaps back, pushing up to the
# "clear everything" toast with many hidden toasts behind it (shadowOpacity
# computed for ids > 3), clearing all with its X (staggered exits), pushing
# again past the end of the list (index wraps), dismissing a toast in the
# middle slot, scrolling the rows behind the toasts, and swiping the rest away.
# Note: the first tap after mounting never shows its toast (see QA report);
# assertions only use the newest toast, which shows either way.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/clerk-toast"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1000
# Rows are unlabeled pressables: tap by position.
press 200 300
wait 700
press 200 300
wait 700
press 200 300
wait 1200
wait "text" "It works with React Native and Expo!" 8000
# Swipe the newest (bottom slot, y ~796) away. The first swipe on a fresh
# stack does not dismiss the toast under the finger (see QA report), so swipe
# twice; the second may also take an older one.
gesture pan 300 796 -250 0 400
wait 1200
gesture pan 300 796 -250 0 400
wait 1200
wait absent "label=\"It works with React Native and Expo!\"" 8000
# Short swipe: snaps back.
gesture pan 300 796 -30 0 500
wait 900
# Up to the "clear everything" toast. Four taps, not five: the very first tap
# of the session fired onPress twice (see QA report), so the list is one
# ahead and "Actually, let's clear..." is now the newest (bottom) toast.
press 200 420
wait 500
press 200 420
wait 500
press 200 420
wait 500
press 200 420
wait 1200
wait "text" "Actually, let's clear quickly everything" 8000
# Its X (trailing pressable) clears the stack.
press 347 796
wait 2000
wait absent "label=\"Actually, let's clear quickly everything\"" 8000
# Past the end of the list: index wraps.
press 200 300
wait 500
press 200 300
wait 500
press 200 300
wait 500
press 200 300
wait 500
press 200 300
wait 1200
wait "text" "Thanks for watching!" 8000
# Dismiss the toast in the middle slot (y ~726).
gesture pan 300 726 -250 0 400
wait 1200
# Scroll the rows behind the toasts and back.
gesture pan 200 500 0 -300 600
wait 800
gesture pan 200 300 0 250 600
wait 800
# Swipe the rest away.
gesture pan 300 796 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 300 796 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 300 796 -250 0 400
wait 900
gesture pan 300 796 -250 0 400
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
